ered_incidents, join_type=inner, condition=documentation_issues.incident_id = filtered_incidents.incident_id)\n  -> GROUP_BY([documentation_issue_type,records_complete,correct_document_on_board], {incident_count:COUNT_DISTINCT(incident_id),canonical_affected_item:MODE(affected_item)})\n  -> ORDER_BY([incident_count DESC,documentation_issue_type ASC,records_complete ASC,correct_document_on_board ASC])\n  -> LIMIT(15)\n  -> PROJECT([rank=ROW_NUMBER(),documentation_issue_type,records_complete,correct_document_on_board,incident_count,canonical_affected_item])\n)\nresult"
